### Feature Description

Optimize models loading to enable llama.cpp to better load models from multi-level directories, such as the LM Studio model directory.

./llama-server --models-dir ~/.lmstudio/models/ --models-max 1 --ctx-size 32768 --n-gpu-layers 9999 --main-gpu 0 --split-mode none --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080




### Motivation

I have always used LM Studio as my model downloader and for initial testing. I tried it out here, but discovered that the system can actually only load models located right under the immediate subdirectories. If a directory is one level deeper, it fails to recognize them.

